    goal: "Master conditional rendering mechanics and reconciliation heuristics: eliminating the falsy zero hazard in logical AND, architecting multi-branch table dispatchers, implementing early return guard clauses while preserving hook order invariants, managing element identity vs state bleed across branches, and building resilient four-state UI topologies.",
